.TH ferry-config-path 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-config\-path \- Print the path of the configuration file
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry config path\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the path of the configuration file
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
